 "description": "Manage mappings in your user folder with action apply|create|list|resolve|update|delete. Optional substitution names a shipped OODS Foundry component, React and/or Vue package exports, and OODS Foundry-to-team prop translations checked against the component contract. The launcher defaults OODS_MAPPINGS_DIR to ~/.oods-foundry/mappings; MCP_MAPPINGS_PATH remains an overriding file path. Legacy Stage1 annotations are preserved; their coercion labels are not executable substitutions. Compose snapshots substitution mappings on OODS Foundry nodes. React/Vue code generation applies team imports and prop translations with exact dependency versions; preview bundles installed or localPath packages and freezes their bytes per version; shared-scenario browser contract reports travel with generation and preview. Unmeasured obligations remain not checked.",
